        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[JSX.IntrinsicElements 报错解决]]></title>
            <link>https://yanyusln.github.io/smoke-rain-year-blog/前端/02.ts类型报错</link>
            <guid>https://yanyusln.github.io/smoke-rain-year-blog/前端/02.ts类型报错</guid>
            <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[TS + JSX 报错"JSX element implicitly has type any because no interface JSX.IntrinsicElements exists"的原因与解决方案]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 id="问题描述" tabindex="-1">问题描述 <a class="header-anchor" href="#问题描述" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;问题描述&quot;"></a></h2>
<p>当在 TypeScript 项目中写 JSX 语法时，编辑器抛出报错：</p>
<blockquote>
<p>JSX element implicitly has type 'any' because no interface 'JSX.IntrinsicElements' exists.</p>
<p>（JSX 元素隐式具有类型 &quot;any&quot;，因为不存在接口 &quot;JSX.IntrinsicElements&quot;。）</p>
</blockquote>
<p>这个错误通常是因为 TypeScript 无法识别 JSX 元素的类型。</p>
<p><img src="/img/article/02.ts类型报错/02.ts类型报错-1.png" alt="TS 报错截图" loading="lazy"></p>
<h2 id="常见原因" tabindex="-1">常见原因 <a class="header-anchor" href="#常见原因" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;常见原因&quot;"></a></h2>
<ol>
<li><code>tsconfig.json</code> 没有配置 <code>jsx</code> 选项，TS 不开启 JSX 解析</li>
<li>框架对应的 <code>jsxImportSource</code> 缺失（Vue / React 两种场景不一样）</li>
<li>缺少类型声明包，或者类型文件没有被 TS 识别</li>
<li>项目 <code>include</code> 没有包含当前 tsx 文件</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="解决方案" tabindex="-1">解决方案 <a class="header-anchor" href="#解决方案" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;解决方案&quot;"></a></h2>
<h3 id="方案1-配置-jsx-推荐" tabindex="-1">方案1：配置 jsx（推荐） <a class="header-anchor" href="#方案1-配置-jsx-推荐" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;方案1：配置 jsx（推荐）&quot;"></a></h3>
<h4 id="vue3-ts-场景" tabindex="-1">Vue3 + TS 场景 <a class="header-anchor" href="#vue3-ts-场景" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Vue3 + TS 场景&quot;"></a></h4>
<div class="language-json vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">json</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0" v-pre=""><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF">  "compilerOptions"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">: {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF">    "jsx"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF">"preserve"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF">    "jsxImportSource"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF">"vue"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">  }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">}</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br><span class="line-number">5</span><br><span class="line-number">6</span><br></div></div><h4 id="react-ts-场景" tabindex="-1">React + TS 场景 <a class="header-anchor" href="#react-ts-场景" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;React + TS 场景&quot;"></a></h4>
<div class="language- vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang"></span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0" v-pre=""><code><span class="line"><span>{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  "compilerOptions": {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "jsx": "react-jsx"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>}</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br><span class="line-number">5</span><br></div></div><blockquote>
<p>React 新版不需要手动指定 <code>jsxImportSource</code>，<code>jsx: react-jsx</code> 会自动引入。</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="方案2-声明-jsx-类型-兜底" tabindex="-1">方案2：声明 JSX 类型（兜底） <a class="header-anchor" href="#方案2-声明-jsx-类型-兜底" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;方案2：声明 JSX 类型（兜底）&quot;"></a></h3>
<p>新建 <code>src/env.d.ts</code> 类型文件，手动声明 JSX 命名空间，适合一些特殊脚手架项目：</p>
<div class="language-ts vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">ts</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0" v-pre=""><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">declare</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583"> namespace</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0"> JSX</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">  interface</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0"> IntrinsicElements</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">    [</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70">elemName</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF"> string</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">]</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583">:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF"> any</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">  }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">}</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br><span class="line-number">5</span><br></div></div><p>确保 <code>tsconfig.json</code> 的 <code>include</code> 包含这个类型文件：</p>
<div class="language-json vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">json</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0" v-pre=""><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF">"include"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">: [</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF">"src/**/*"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">]</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br></div></div><h3 id="方案3-关闭隐式-any-不推荐" tabindex="-1">方案3：关闭隐式 any（不推荐） <a class="header-anchor" href="#方案3-关闭隐式-any-不推荐" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;方案3：关闭隐式 any（不推荐）&quot;"></a></h3>
<blockquote>
<p>仅临时调试使用，会丢失大量类型校验，正式项目不建议。</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="language-json vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">json</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0" v-pre=""><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF">  "compilerOptions"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">: {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF">    "noImplicitAny"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF">false</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">  }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8">}</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br><span class="line-number">5</span><br></div></div><h3 id="方案4-检查依赖" tabindex="-1">方案4：检查依赖 <a class="header-anchor" href="#方案4-检查依赖" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;方案4：检查依赖&quot;"></a></h3>
<ul>
<li>Vue：确认安装 <code>vue</code>，自带类型</li>
<li>React：确认安装 <code>@types/react</code></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="排查小技巧" tabindex="-1">排查小技巧 <a class="header-anchor" href="#排查小技巧" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;排查小技巧&quot;"></a></h2>
<ol>
<li>修改 tsconfig 后<strong>重启 TS 服务</strong>（VSCode：Ctrl+Shift+P → Restart TypeScript Service）</li>
<li>确认文件后缀是 <code>.tsx</code>，<code>.ts</code> 文件默认不识别 JSX</li>
<li>检查是否存在多个 tsconfig 覆盖配置</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="总结" tabindex="-1">总结 <a class="header-anchor" href="#总结" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;总结&quot;"></a></h2>
<p>绝大多数情况是 <code>tsconfig.json</code> 的 <code>jsx</code> 配置缺失。优先按框架配置 <code>jsx</code> 和 <code>jsxImportSource</code>；只有特殊场景才手动声明 <code>JSX.IntrinsicElements</code>，尽量不要直接关闭 <code>noImplicitAny</code>。</p>
]]></content:encoded>
